          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do you design logos for businesses in Kyle, TX?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin designs logos for Kyle businesses and completes projects by phone, text and email.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can you design my restaurant menu along with the logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
